<title>JAPAN: Toyo Chemical to issue 30 mln SFR warrant.</title>
<headline>Toyo Chemical to issue 30 mln SFR warrant.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Toyo Chemical Co Ltd</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Banque Paribas (Suisse) S.A.</p>
<p>GUARANTOR - Dai-Ichi Kangyo Bank Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE warrant	   ISSUE NO		AMT   30 million SFR</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISS PRICE PAR	 MATURITY 12.Sep.00</p>
<p> EXER PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p> EXER FROM 26.Sep.96  EXER TO 29.Aug.00</p>
<p> LAST MOODY	     PAY DATE 12.Sep.96  INT PAY 12.Sep</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE 3.Sep.96  SUB DATE</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p>The coupon, conversion price and currency rate will be decided on September 3.</p>
</text>
